    "scoreScale": "0 unusable, 5 mixed but playable, 7 good with meaningful friction, 9 excellent with minor friction, 10 exceptional across assessed scope. Subjective holistic emulated-mobile scores, not derived from win/loss or terminal score; no physical-device certification.",
    "scoreReasons": {
      "overallMobile": "Clear short mission and helpful touch assistance offset small-target/cover ambiguity and dense overlays. Limited to the two observed runs.",
      "controls": "Simultaneous MOVE/FIRE drag, scene turn and DASH responded visibly. Target taps and assistance help; pillar occlusion and interrupted holds limit confidence in continuous combat.",
      "gameplay": "Recoveries, relay armor/optic and coil stages provide understandable progression and corrections. Heavy assisted traversal and short paused runs leave depth, sustained challenge and continuous enjoyment unassessed.",
      "presentation": "Cohesive rain, wet surfaces and cyan/gold visual language; attractive title and clean result screen in emulation. Audio and hardware smoothness unassessed.",
      "usability": "Contextual HOLD action, visible mission checks, map and explicit assistance stats helped progress. Repeated turn cues and off-screen damage impose orientation work.",
      "readability": "Core health/ammo/objective legible; optic/coil labels and small distant threats are harder at landscape mobile size, with translucent control overlays competing with scene."
    },
